---
Stat, list, search, change and digest files in the project's roots: the Fs port for people and agents (ADR 0339)

Usage: specforge files <COMMAND>

Commands:
  stat    Each path's kind, size and modification time, or that it does not exist
  list    The files and directories under a directory, honouring .gitignore
  search  The lines under the paths that match a regular expression
  read    A file's text (at most 1 MiB), its size in bytes and its lines
  temp    A new empty file, or directory, with a name no other has, in the project's temp root (only you may read it)
  mkdir   Make each directory, with its missing parents
  copy    Copy a file, or a directory and what it holds, onto a path or into a directory
  move    Move a file or directory onto a path or into a directory
  remove  Remove each file, or empty directory (with --recursive, a directory and what it holds)
  digest  The SHA-256 of each file, and of --text
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
